2010:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       by a timer instance.
2011:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @note Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2012:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2013:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *       due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
2014:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @rmtoll CR1          DIR           LL_TIM_SetCounterMode\n
2015:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *         CR1          CMS           LL_TIM_SetCounterMode
2016:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  TIMx Timer instance
2017:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  CounterMode This parameter can be one of the following values:
